Doc: * Creates a result indicating local DJL model failed but fallback may be available.
     *
     * @param fallbackAvailable whether the Ollama fallback model (nomic-embed-text) is available
Signature: public static EmbeddingModelCheckResult localFailedWithFallback(boolean fallbackAvailable)
Body: {
