Method: fr.baretto.ollamassist.utils.FontUtils#deriveWithRelativeSize
Doc: * Derive a font with a relative size multiplier.
     * For example, multiplier=1.5f will make the font 50% larger.
Signature: public static Font deriveWithRelativeSize(Font base, float multiplier)
Body: {
    if (base == null) {
        base = UIUtil.getLabelFont();
    }
    float size = base.getSize() * multiplier * currentMultiplier;
    return base.deriveFont(size);
}


